{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019kvkpJvvPVqvTiEtksKU1G","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立：DIF是RL无法掩盖的唯一污染信号（因为它操作在群体级ICC上）， 结合多信号ensemble实现全效应量覆盖，bifactor\n2\t  IRT等值实现心理测量等价的benchmark再生。 Headline: \"在5,219个模型的最大规模DIF分析中，ETS C在δ≥1.4时达到TPR 0.72-0.85/FPR<0.05，\n3\t  且在RL训练模型上保持检测力，而10种现有方法退化至随机水平。\" 三条Claim均以强形式陈述，无需降级。\n4\t\n5\t  '\n6\timagined_experiments:\n7\t- name: Real-Data DIF on METABENCH MMLU\n8\t  plan_id: plan_001\n9\t  description: '在METABENCH 5,219模型×12,508题的完整响应矩阵上执行ETS C DIF检测。 时序队列(2023 N=1253\n10\t    vs 2024-H1 N=658)，能力五分位队列， ±负区分度题敏感性分析，within-family混淆控制，领域特异性分析。\n11\t\n12\t    '\n13\t  expected_results:\n14\t    n_items_ets_c_flagged_temporal: 1850\n15\t    n_items_ets_c_flagged_quintile: 2100\n16\t    pct_flagged_temporal: 0.148\n17\t    pct_flagged_quintile: 0.168\n18\t    li_et_al_overlap_precision: 0.62\n19\t    li_et_al_overlap_recall: 0.38\n20\t    li_et_al_correlation_phi: 0.31\n21\t    temporal_vs_quintile_flag_overlap_jaccard: 0.58\n22\t    neg_disc_sensitivity_flag_delta_pct: -12.0\n23\t    within_family_llama_n_dif_items: 280\n24\t    within_family_qwen_n_dif_items: 195\n25\t    cross_cohort_within_family_overlap_pct: 68.0\n26\t    domain_specificity_stem_overrepresentation_or: 1.8\n27\t    domain_specificity_humanities_underrepresentation_or: 0.65\n28\t  result_rationale: '时序队列N远超模拟的80-100（实际1253 vs 658），统计功效充裕，ETS C的effect-size阈值 (|ΔMH|≥1.5)在大样本下更精确。Li\n29\t    et al.标注的39.5%污染率中，约60-65%的\"input+label\" 类污染会产生δ≥1.4的大效应量DIF（模型见过完整题答对概率显著上升），因此precision~0.62。\n30\t    Recall受限于δ<1.4的中小效应量污染（Li et al.的input-only类别），约0.38。 Within-family分析中Llama-2→3→3.1跨代能力增长是已知的，但DIF标记主要集中在STEM领域\n31\t    （已知训练数据中代码/数学语料重复率高），且cross-cohort与within-family重叠率68%表明 大部分DIF标记反映的是污染而非纯能力增长——能力增长应在within-family中不产生DIF\n32\t    （因为同一family的能力轨迹被控制了），只有当新版本额外暴露于更多训练数据时才会出现。 负区分度题移除后flag数下降12%，说明这些病态题会产生少量虚假DIF。\n33\t\n34\t    '\n35\t  tables:\n36\t  - name: 'Table 1: DIF Detection Summary by Cohort Definition'\n37\t    columns:\n38\t    - cohort_type\n39\t    - n_focal\n40\t    - n_reference\n41\t    - n_flagged_C\n42\t    - pct_flagged\n43\t    - li_precision\n44\t    - li_recall\n45\t    rows:\n46\t    - - temporal (2023 vs 2024)\n47\t      - 658\n48\t      - 1253\n49\t      - 1850\n50\t      - 14.8%\n51\t      - 0.62\n52\t      - 0.38\n53\t    - - quintile (Q5 vs Q1-Q3)\n54\t      - 1044\n55\t      - 3131\n56\t      - 2100\n57\t      - 16.8%\n58\t      - 0.58\n59\t      - 0.42\n60\t    - - temporal, neg-disc removed\n61\t      - 658\n62\t      - 1253\n63\t      - 1630\n64\t      - 15.3%*\n65\t      - 0.67\n66\t      - 0.34\n67\t    - - temporal, within-family Llama\n68\t      - 135\n69\t      - 308\n70\t      - 280\n71\t      - 2.2%\n72\t      - —\n73\t      - —\n74\t  - name: 'Table 2: Domain-Specificity of DIF Flags'\n75\t    columns:\n76\t    - domain_cluster\n77\t    - n_items\n78\t    - n_flagged\n79\t    - flag_rate\n80\t    - odds_ratio_vs_baseline\n81\t    rows:\n82\t    - - STEM (math/physics/CS)\n83\t      - 3200\n84\t      - 620\n85\t      - 19.4%\n86\t      - 1.8\n87\t    - - Social Sciences\n88\t      - 3800\n89\t      - 510\n90\t      - 13.4%\n91\t      - 0.95\n92\t    - - Humanities\n93\t      - 3100\n94\t      - 340\n95\t      - 11.0%\n96\t      - 0.65\n97\t    - - Professional/Other\n98\t      - 2408\n99\t      - 380\n100\t      - 15.8%\n101\t      - 1.1\n102\t  figures_description:\n103\t  - 'Figure 1: Heatmap of DIF flag density across 57 MMLU subjects, colored by ETS\n104\t    C magnitude. STEM subjects show systematic hot spots.'\n105\t  - 'Figure 2: Venn diagram of temporal vs quintile vs within-family DIF flags, showing\n106\t    68% overlap between cross-cohort and within-family.'\n107\t  - 'Figure 3: Scatter plot of per-item DIF ΔMH vs Li et al. contamination category\n108\t    (clean/input-only/input+label), showing clear separation for input+label items.'\n109\t  analysis: 'Real-data DIF在METABENCH规模上运行成功，14.8%的题目被标记为ETS C级DIF，与Li et al. 的39.5%总污染率一致（DIF仅捕获大效应量污染）。Within-family分析是关键混淆控制：\n110\t    68%的重叠率表明DIF标记主要反映污染暴露差异，而非纯能力演进。STEM领域的1.8×过度表征 与已知的代码/数学训练数据重复模式一致，增强了因果推断。负区分度题敏感性分析建议\n111\t    在主分析中排除这些题目以减少FPR，但定性结论不变。\n112\t\n113\t    '\n114\t- name: RL Robustness Empirical Validation\n115\t  plan_id: plan_002\n116\t  description: '三队列设计验证DIF的RL鲁棒性：SFT-only基线、alignment-RL(DPO/ORPO, N=477)、 reasoning-RL(DeepSeek-R1/Qwen2.5-RL等10-15个GRPO/PPO模型混入focal队列)。\n117\t    同时在reasoning-RL模型上运行Min-K%和ConStat作为对比基线。 部分利用率功率分析：p∈[0.4,1.0]的DIF效应量衰减曲线。\n118\t\n119\t    '\n120\t  expected_results:\n121\t    dif_retention_ratio_alignment_rl: 0.97\n122\t    dif_retention_ratio_reasoning_rl_mixed: 0.93\n123\t    constat_auroc_non_rl: 0.78\n124\t    constat_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.53\n125\t    mink_auroc_non_rl: 0.72\n126\t    mink_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.51\n127\t    dif_auroc_stable: 0.91\n128\t    delong_p_dif_vs_constat_rl: 0.0003\n129\t    tost_equivalence_dif_retention_p: 0.02\n130\t    partial_exploitation_p1_tpr: 0.78\n131\t    partial_exploitation_p08_tpr: 0.68\n132\t    partial_exploitation_p06_tpr: 0.52\n133\t    partial_exploitation_p05_tpr: 0.41\n134\t    partial_exploitation_p04_tpr: 0.3\n135\t    ensemble_handoff_point_p: 0.52\n136\t    bootstrap_ci_dif_auroc_95:\n137\t    - 0.88\n138\t    - 0.94\n139\t    bootstrap_ci_constat_rl_auroc_95:\n140\t    - 0.47\n141\t    - 0.59\n142\t  result_rationale: 'DIF的RL鲁棒性来自其操作层级：它检测的是群体级ICC偏移（\"这批模型对这道题异常容易\"）， 而非单模型的output\n143\t    distribution。GRPO/PPO平滑的是单模型的token-level概率分布 （NLL gap contraction），但无法改变\"已污染模型答对概率更高\"这一群体行为模式——\n144\t    除非RL训练恰好让模型\"忘记\"污染知识，而这与污染的定义矛盾。 Alignment-RL(DPO)的retention ratio更高(0.97)是因为DPO根本不涉及NLL\n145\t    gap机制。 Reasoning-RL混入后retention ratio 0.93（>0.90阈值）：混入10-15个RL模型到N=658的 focal队列中，对群体ICC的影响微乎其微（<2.3%的样本）。\n146\t    ConStat在reasoning-RL上退化至0.53（近随机）是因为GRPO训练使模型对输入扰动的敏感度 被系统性平滑——Wang et al.已实证报告14-20pp\n147\t    AUROC下降。 部分利用率分析：p=1.0时效应量=全量δ，TPR=0.78；p降低时效应量线性缩放~p×δ， 在p≈0.52时DIF的TPR降至~0.41，此时ensemble的ConStat信号(对非RL模型有效)接手覆盖。\n148\t\n149\t    '\n150\t  tables:\n151\t  - name: 'Table 3: DIF vs Baseline Detectors across Model Types'\n152\t    columns:\n153\t    - detector\n154\t    - cohort\n155\t    - auroc\n156\t    - auroc_95ci_lo\n157\t    - auroc_95ci_hi\n158\t    - tpr_at_fpr05\n159\t    rows:\n160\t    - - DIF (ETS C)\n161\t      - SFT-only\n162\t      - 0.92\n163\t      - 0.89\n164\t      - 0.95\n165\t      - 0.79\n166\t    - - DIF (ETS C)\n167\t      - Alignment-RL mixed\n168\t      - 0.91\n169\t      - 0.88\n170\t      - 0.94\n171\t      - 0.78\n172\t    - - DIF (ETS C)\n173\t      - Reasoning-RL mixed\n174\t      - 0.91\n175\t      - 0.88\n176\t      - 0.94\n177\t      - 0.76\n178\t    - - ConStat\n179\t      - SFT-only\n180\t      - 0.78\n181\t      - 0.73\n182\t      - 0.83\n183\t      - 0.55\n184\t    - - ConStat\n185\t      - Reasoning-RL (individual)\n186\t      - 0.53\n187\t      - 0.47\n188\t      - 0.59\n189\t      - 0.12\n190\t    - - Min-K%\n191\t      - SFT-only\n192\t      - 0.72\n193\t      - 0.66\n194\t      - 0.78\n195\t      - 0.42\n196\t    - - Min-K%\n197\t      - Reasoning-RL (individual)\n198\t      - 0.51\n199\t      - 0.44\n200\t      - 0.58\n201\t      - 0.08\n202\t  - name: 'Table 4: Partial Exploitation Power Curve'\n203\t    columns:\n204\t    - exploitation_rate_p\n205\t    - effective_delta\n206\t    - ets_c_tpr\n207\t    - ensemble_tpr\n208\t    - coverage_gap\n209\t    rows:\n210\t    - - 1.0\n211\t      - 1.6\n212\t      - 0.78\n213\t      - 0.82\n214\t      - none\n215\t    - - 0.8\n216\t      - 1.28\n217\t      - 0.68\n218\t      - 0.74\n219\t      - none\n220\t    - - 0.6\n221\t      - 0.96\n222\t      - 0.52\n223\t      - 0.65\n224\t      - none (ConStat补)\n225\t    - - 0.5\n226\t      - 0.8\n227\t      - 0.41\n228\t      - 0.58\n229\t      - marginal\n230\t    - - 0.4\n231\t      - 0.64\n232\t      - 0.3\n233\t      - 0.48\n234\t      - ensemble边界\n235\t  figures_description:\n236\t  - 'Figure 4: Paired bar chart — DIF AUROC stays flat (~0.91) across three cohort\n237\t    compositions while ConStat/Min-K% collapse on reasoning-RL. Error bars are bootstrap\n238\t    95% CIs.'\n239\t  - 'Figure 5: Partial exploitation power curve — DIF TPR as function of p, with ensemble\n240\t    handoff zone shaded. Shows DIF→ensemble transition at p≈0.52.'\n241\t  analysis: 'RL鲁棒性以双层证据确认：(1)群体级DIF在三种队列组成下AUROC稳定在0.91±0.03， TOST等价检验p=0.02拒绝了\"DIF在RL队列中退化\"的假设；(2)个体级ConStat/Min-K%\n242\t    在reasoning-RL模型上退化至随机水平(0.51-0.53)。DeLong检验p=0.0003确认DIF 与ConStat在RL模型上的AUROC差异具有统计显著性。部分利用率分析画出了清晰的\n243\t    覆盖边界：DIF单独覆盖p≥0.6，ensemble补完至p≈0.4-0.5，p<0.4时污染对排名 影响已可忽略(δ<0.64，对应排名变动<2位)。\n244\t\n245\t    '\n246\t- name: ConStat Perturbation Testing Evaluation\n247\t  plan_id: plan_003a\n248\t  description: '在200+道MMLU题上生成语义等价重述，对比原始vs重述表现，执行FDR控制检测。 评估对非RL模型的检测力，以及对RL模型的预期退化。\n249\t\n250\t    '\n251\t  expected_results:\n252\t    n_items_reformulated: 250\n253\t    n_models_evaluated: 50\n254\t    constat_auroc_non_rl: 0.78\n255\t    constat_auroc_full_population: 0.68\n256\t    constat_fdr_controlled_tpr_non_rl: 0.52\n257\t    constat_fdr_controlled_fpr: 0.04\n258\t    constat_auroc_rl_models: 0.53\n259\t    perturbation_sensitivity_mean_non_rl: 0.18\n260\t    perturbation_sensitivity_mean_rl: 0.06\n261\t    perturbation_sensitivity_ratio: 3.0\n262\t  result_rationale: 'ConStat的机制是检测模型对语义等价扰动的不对称敏感性：污染模型对原始题目 过拟合，重述后表现下降更大。非RL模型的output\n263\t    distribution保留了这种不对称 （训练时直接记忆了原始措辞），AUROC~0.78。RL模型经过GRPO/PPO后，token概率 被平滑化（NLL\n264\t    gap缩小），对扰动的敏感性差异被抹平，AUROC退化至0.53。 扰动敏感性比值3.0（非RL/RL）直接量化了RL平滑效应的程度。这个结果验证了 ConStat作为ensemble中非RL模型专用信号的定位。\n265\t\n266\t    '\n267\t  tables:\n268\t  - name: 'Table 5: ConStat Detection Power by Model Type'\n269\t    columns:\n270\t    - model_type\n271\t    - n_models\n272\t    - auroc\n273\t    - tpr_at_fdr05\n274\t    - mean_sensitivity\n275\t    rows:\n276\t    - - SFT-only\n277\t      - 25\n278\t      - 0.78\n279\t      - 0.52\n280\t      - 0.18\n281\t    - - DPO/ORPO\n282\t      - 15\n283\t      - 0.62\n284\t      - 0.35\n285\t      - 0.11\n286\t    - - GRPO/PPO\n287\t      - 10\n288\t      - 0.53\n289\t      - 0.12\n290\t      - 0.06\n291\t    - - All\n292\t      - 50\n293\t      - 0.68\n294\t      - 0.4\n295\t      - 0.13\n296\t  figures_description:\n297\t  - 'Figure 6: Distribution of perturbation sensitivity scores by model type, showing\n298\t    clear bimodal separation for SFT-only models and collapsed distribution for GRPO/PPO\n299\t    models.'\n300\t  analysis: 'ConStat在非RL模型上表现可靠(AUROC 0.78)，填补DIF在中效应量区间的覆盖空白。 关键发现是RL平滑效应的定量刻画：GRPO/PPO模型的扰动敏感性仅为SFT模型的1/3，\n301\t    直接解释了Wang et al.报告的AUROC退化。这为ensemble设计提供了明确的信号分配策略。\n302\t\n303\t    '\n304\t- name: DVD Generation Variance Evaluation\n305\t  plan_id: plan_003b\n306\t  description: '对10-15个开放权重模型，每题生成50个响应(T=0.7-1.0)，计算生成方差， 检测双峰分布（variant污染信号）。\n307\t\n308\t    '\n309\t  expected_results:\n310\t    n_models_evaluated: 12\n311\t    n_items_tested: 500\n312\t    dvd_variant_detection_tpr: 0.68\n313\t    dvd_variant_detection_fpr: 0.07\n314\t    dvd_verbatim_detection_tpr: 0.45\n315\t    dvd_bimodal_items_detected: 85\n316\t    generation_entropy_clean_mean: 1.42\n317\t    generation_entropy_contaminated_mean: 0.73\n318\t    entropy_separation_cohens_d: 1.15\n319\t  result_rationale: 'DVD检测的机制是：变体污染（模型见过原题的不同版本）会导致生成分布出现多模态 ——模型在不同\"记忆版本\"之间切换。对于variant\n320\t    contamination（δ≥0.8）， 生成方差显著降低（entropy从1.42降至0.73），TPR达0.68。对verbatim contamination，\n321\t    模型响应高度集中在唯一正确答案上，方差反而极低但不呈双峰，所以TPR仅0.45—— 这正是DIF信号的覆盖区域。entropy的Cohen''s d=1.15说明clean\n322\t    vs contaminated 题目在生成分布层面的差异是大效应量的。\n323\t\n324\t    '\n325\t  tables:\n326\t  - name: 'Table 6: DVD Detection by Contamination Type'\n327\t    columns:\n328\t    - contamination_type\n329\t    - n_items\n330\t    - tpr\n331\t    - fpr\n332\t    - mean_entropy\n333\t    rows:\n334\t    - - variant\n335\t      - 120\n336\t      - 0.68\n337\t      - 0.07\n338\t      - 0.73\n339\t    - - verbatim\n340\t      - 180\n341\t      - 0.45\n342\t      - 0.05\n343\t      - 0.38\n344\t    - - clean\n345\t      - 200\n346\t      - —\n347\t      - 0.07\n348\t      - 1.42\n349\t  figures_description:\n350\t  - 'Figure 7: Kernel density estimates of generation entropy for clean, verbatim-contaminated,\n351\t    and variant-contaminated items, showing clear three-way separation.'\n352\t  analysis: 'DVD填补了ensemble中variant contamination的检测空白。与DIF互补性强： DIF擅长verbatim大效应量(TPR~0.78)，DVD擅长variant中等效应量(TPR~0.68)。\n353\t    两者的FPR均在可接受范围。\n354\t\n355\t    '\n356\t- name: Multi-Signal Ensemble Fusion\n357\t  plan_id: plan_003c\n358\t  description: '融合DIF+ConStat+DVD为多信号ensemble，校准阈值，评估覆盖率和FPR。 2-of-3投票 vs 加权融合，5折交叉验证。\n359\t\n360\t    '\n361\t  expected_results:\n362\t    ensemble_tpr_delta_ge_1_4: 0.82\n363\t    ensemble_tpr_delta_ge_0_8: 0.72\n364\t    ensemble_fpr: 0.055\n365\t    majority_vote_tpr: 0.74\n366\t    majority_vote_fpr: 0.04\n367\t    weighted_fusion_tpr: 0.78\n368\t    weighted_fusion_fpr: 0.06\n369\t    uniform_weight_tpr: 0.75\n370\t    uniform_weight_fpr: 0.055\n371\t    cv_5fold_tpr_std: 0.03\n372\t    cv_5fold_fpr_std: 0.01\n373\t    coverage_dif_only_pct: 58\n374\t    coverage_ensemble_pct: 82\n375\t    marginal_gain_constat: 15\n376\t    marginal_gain_dvd: 9\n377\t  result_rationale: 'Ensemble的核心价值在于互补覆盖：DIF覆盖大效应量(δ≥1.4)+RL-robust场景， ConStat覆盖中效应量(δ∈[0.6,1.4])+非RL模型，DVD覆盖variant\n378\t    contamination。 三信号组合后，总覆盖率从DIF单信号的58%提升至82%。2-of-3投票更保守(FPR 0.04) 但TPR牺牲(0.74)；加权融合(DIF权重0.45,\n379\t    ConStat 0.35, DVD 0.20)在5折CV上 达到TPR 0.78/FPR 0.06的最优平衡。FPR<0.08满足best档指标。 交叉验证TPR标准差仅0.03，说明融合权重稳定。\n380\t\n381\t    '\n382\t  tables:\n383\t  - name: 'Table 7: Ensemble Strategies Comparison'\n384\t    columns:\n385\t    - strategy\n386\t    - tpr_delta_ge_1.4\n387\t    - tpr_delta_ge_0.8\n388\t    - fpr\n389\t    - coverage_pct\n390\t    rows:\n391\t    - - DIF only\n392\t      - 0.78\n393\t      - 0.51\n394\t      - 0.04\n395\t      - 58\n396\t    - - ConStat only\n397\t      - 0.52\n398\t      - 0.45\n399\t      - 0.04\n400\t      - 38\n401\t    - - DVD only\n402\t      - 0.45\n403\t      - 0.42\n404\t      - 0.07\n405\t      - 32\n406\t    - - 2-of-3 majority\n407\t      - 0.74\n408\t      - 0.62\n409\t      - 0.04\n410\t      - 72\n411\t    - - Weighted fusion (optimized)\n412\t      - 0.78\n413\t      - 0.68\n414\t      - 0.06\n415\t      - 78\n416\t    - - Weighted fusion (uniform)\n417\t      - 0.75\n418\t      - 0.65\n419\t      - 0.055\n420\t      - 75\n421\t    - - Full ensemble (union)\n422\t      - 0.82\n423\t      - 0.72\n424\t      - 0.055\n425\t      - 82\n426\t  figures_description:\n427\t  - 'Figure 8: Stacked coverage chart showing each signal''s unique and shared detection\n428\t    regions across the effect-size × model-type landscape.'\n429\t  - 'Figure 9: ROC curves for individual signals and ensemble strategies, with per-signal\n430\t    confidence bands.'\n431\t  analysis: 'Ensemble实现了\"全效应量覆盖\"的Claim 2：每个信号覆盖其他信号的盲区。 ConStat的边际增益(+15%)大于DVD(+9%)，因为中效应量污染比variant污染更常见。\n432\t    Uniform权重基线(TPR 0.75)仅比优化权重低3pp，说明融合策略对权重选择不敏感—— 这是审稿人喜欢看到的鲁棒性证据。\n433\t\n434\t    '\n435\t- name: Cross-Benchmark GSM8K Validation\n436\t  plan_id: plan_004\n437\t  description: '在GSM8K上复现DIF分析，利用GSM1K作为独立ground truth。 收集50+模型的逐题binary response，跨时序队列运行DIF，\n438\t    将DIF标记与per-model GSM8K-GSM1K accuracy gap关联。\n439\t\n440\t    '\n441\t  expected_results:\n442\t    n_models_gsm8k: 65\n443\t    n_items_gsm8k: 1319\n444\t    gsm8k_dif_flagged_items: 185\n445\t    gsm8k_dif_flag_rate: 0.14\n446\t    gsm8k_gsm1k_gap_mean: 0.085\n447\t    gsm8k_dif_gap_correlation_r: 0.58\n448\t    gsm8k_dif_gap_correlation_p: 1.0e-05\n449\t    dif_flagged_items_mean_gap: 0.13\n450\t    dif_clean_items_mean_gap: 0.06\n451\t    gap_difference_cohens_d: 0.92\n452\t  result_rationale: 'GSM8K是DIF验证的理想案例：GSM1K提供了真正独立的ground truth（完全新写的1000道 数学题），GSM8K-GSM1K\n453\t    accuracy gap直接反映污染影响。r=0.58的相关性来自： DIF标记的题目正是那些模型在原始GSM8K上\"异常好\"（因为见过）而在GSM1K上表现\n454\t    正常（没见过）的题目。被DIF标记题目的平均gap(0.13)是未标记题(0.06)的2.2倍， Cohen''s d=0.92构成大效应量差异。样本量(N=65模型)小于MMLU的5219，但GSM8K\n455\t    题目同质性更高（全是数学），IRT拟合更好，部分补偿了样本量劣势。\n456\t\n457\t    '\n458\t  tables:\n459\t  - name: 'Table 8: GSM8K DIF vs GSM1K Gap Analysis'\n460\t    columns:\n461\t    - item_group\n462\t    - n_items\n463\t    - mean_gap\n464\t    - std_gap\n465\t    - dif_flag_rate\n466\t    rows:\n467\t    - - DIF-flagged (ETS C)\n468\t      - 185\n469\t      - 0.13\n470\t      - 0.08\n471\t      - 1.0\n472\t    - - DIF-clean\n473\t      - 1134\n474\t      - 0.06\n475\t      - 0.05\n476\t      - 0.0\n477\t    - - All GSM8K\n478\t      - 1319\n479\t      - 0.07\n480\t      - 0.06\n481\t      - 0.14\n482\t  figures_description:\n483\t  - 'Figure 10: Scatter plot of per-item DIF ΔMH magnitude vs GSM8K-GSM1K gap, with\n484\t    regression line and 95% CI band. r=0.58.'\n485\t  analysis: 'GSM8K验证提供了独立于MMLU的cross-benchmark证据。r=0.58的相关性虽然不是完美 对应（因为GSM1K gap也受能力差异影响），但在可控混淆下仍然构成strong\n486\t    evidence。 这直接回应了Reviewer Concern #3（\"仅在模拟中验证\"）和#8（ground truth可靠性）。\n487\t\n488\t    '\n489\t- name: Bifactor IRT Equating Pilot\n490\t  plan_id: plan_005\n491\t  description: '在METABENCH MMLU数据上拟合bifactor模型(general factor + 57 subject-specific\n492\t    factors)， 选锚题，执行fixed-parameter calibration等值，验证等值后排名保持度。\n493\t\n494\t    '\n495\t  expected_results:\n496\t    bifactor_converged: true\n497\t    bifactor_rmsea: 0.043\n498\t    bifactor_cfi: 0.94\n499\t    bifactor_general_factor_variance_explained: 0.62\n500\t    n_anchor_items_selected: 800\n501\t    anchor_stability_icc: 0.96\n502\t    anchor_cross_cohort_dif_rate: 0.02\n503\t    equating_spearman_rho: 0.975\n504\t    equating_kendall_tau: 0.962\n505\t    equating_rank_displacement_mean: 1.8\n506\t    equating_rank_displacement_max: 12\n507\t    n_items_replaced: 500\n508\t    replaced_difficulty_correlation: 0.88\n509\t    replaced_discrimination_correlation: 0.82\n510\t  result_rationale: 'Bifactor模型在大样本(N=5219)上收敛性好——METABENCH的样本量远超心理测量学 通常要求的N=500-1000。General\n511\t    factor解释62%方差反映MMLU测量的主要是一般 认知能力/知识广度，subject-specific factors吸收了领域特异能力。RMSEA=0.043\n512\t    在decoder-only为主的群体上拟合良好（异质性主要来自架构差异，而decoder-only 占70%+）。800道锚题的筛选标准是：(1)跨队列无DIF标记，(2)discrimination>0.3，\n513\t    (3)difficulty在[-2,2]内。等值后Spearman rho=0.975表明：即使替换了500道题， bifactor等值框架成功保持了模型排名，平均排名位移仅1.8位。\n514\t\n515\t    '\n516\t  tables:\n517\t  - name: 'Table 9: Bifactor Model Fit Statistics'\n518\t    columns:\n519\t    - metric\n520\t    - full_population\n521\t    - decoder_only_subset\n522\t    - threshold\n523\t    rows:\n524\t    - - RMSEA\n525\t      - 0.062\n526\t      - 0.043\n527\t      - <0.08 acceptable / <0.05 good\n528\t    - - CFI\n529\t      - 0.91\n530\t      - 0.94\n531\t      - '>0.90 acceptable / >0.95 good'\n532\t    - - General factor % variance\n533\t      - 0.58\n534\t      - 0.62\n535\t      - '>0.50'\n536\t    - - N anchor items\n537\t      - 780\n538\t      - 800\n539\t      - '>500'\n540\t  - name: 'Table 10: Equating Quality Metrics'\n541\t    columns:\n542\t    - metric\n543\t    - value\n544\t    - target\n545\t    rows:\n546\t    - - Spearman ρ (original vs equated)\n547\t      - 0.975\n548\t      - ≥0.95\n549\t    - - Kendall τ\n550\t      - 0.962\n551\t      - ≥0.93\n552\t    - - Mean rank displacement\n553\t      - 1.8\n554\t      - <5\n555\t    - - Max rank displacement\n556\t      - 12\n557\t      - <20\n558\t    - - '% models within ±3 ranks'\n559\t      - 89%\n560\t      - '>80%'\n561\t  figures_description:\n562\t  - 'Figure 11: Bifactor path diagram showing general and subject-specific factor\n563\t    loadings.'\n564\t  - 'Figure 12: Original vs equated model rankings scatter plot with identity line,\n565\t    showing tight clustering around diagonal.'\n566\t  analysis: 'Bifactor等值成功实现了Claim 3的核心承诺：被污染题可以被替换，且替换后的benchmark 通过psychometric equating保持与原始benchmark的可比性。ρ=0.975远超0.95阈值，\n567\t    说明等值框架在实践中是有效的。General factor的62%方差解释率也验证了单一general ability维度假设的合理性，为unidimensional\n568\t    IRT在DIF检测中的应用提供了理论支撑。\n569\t\n570\t    '\n571\t- name: Item Generation & Calibration\n572\t  plan_id: plan_006\n573\t  description: '为DIF标记的MMLU题目生成替换题，使用student simulation进行经验校准， 对比prompt-based difficulty\n574\t    targeting vs empirical calibration。\n575\t\n576\t    '\n577\t  expected_results:\n578\t    n_items_generated: 500\n579\t    n_items_passing_quality: 420\n580\t    student_sim_difficulty_rho: 0.79\n581\t    prompt_based_difficulty_rho: 0.28\n582\t    student_sim_discrimination_rho: 0.72\n583\t    construct_coverage_maintained: true\n584\t    holdout_validation_rho: 0.76\n585\t    generation_pass_rate: 0.84\n586\t    subject_distribution_kl_divergence: 0.03\n587\t  result_rationale: 'Student simulation (arXiv 2601.09953)通过模拟不同能力水平的\"学生模型\"回答新题 来经验估计难度，绕过了直接prompt\n588\t    difficulty targeting的根本困难（LLM无法准确 预测自己的正确率）。rho=0.79的难度相关性在文献报告的0.75-0.82范围内。\n589\t    Prompt-based targeting仅rho=0.28（文献报告0.10-0.45），差距2.8×。 区分度相关性0.72稍低是因为区分度取决于题目与能力的非线性关系，更难通过\n590\t    生成控制。84%的生成通过率说明LLM在给定construct约束下生成高质量MCQ是可行的。\n591\t\n592\t    '\n593\t  tables:\n594\t  - name: 'Table 11: Calibration Method Comparison'\n595\t    columns:\n596\t    - method\n597\t    - difficulty_ρ\n598\t    - discrimination_ρ\n599\t    - construct_match\n600\t    - items_passing\n601\t    rows:\n602\t    - - Student simulation\n603\t      - 0.79\n604\t      - 0.72\n605\t      - 92%\n606\t      - 420\n607\t    - - Prompt-based targeting\n608\t      - 0.28\n609\t      - 0.21\n610\t      - 88%\n611\t      - 380\n612\t    - - Random generation (baseline)\n613\t      - 0.05\n614\t      - 0.03\n615\t      - 75%\n616\t      - 280\n617\t  figures_description:\n618\t  - 'Figure 13: Calibration scatter plots — student-sim predicted vs actual difficulty,\n619\t    prompt-based vs actual, side by side.'\n620\t  analysis: 'Student simulation calibration显著优于prompt-based targeting，验证了 \"经验校准优于语言指定\"的核心假设。结合plan_005的bifactor等值，\n621\t    完整的regeneration pipeline(DIF检测→题目生成→经验校准→等值)已可行。\n622\t\n623\t    '\n624\t- name: Cumulative Bayesian DIF\n625\t  plan_id: plan_007\n626\t  description: '实现Sinharay et al. (2006)累积贝叶斯DIF先验。模拟4次连续benchmark评估， 展示证据累积如何提升中等效应量的检测力。\n627\t\n628\t    '\n629\t  expected_results:\n630\t    single_admin_power_delta_1_0: 0.42\n631\t    cumulative_2_admin_power: 0.55\n632\t    cumulative_3_admin_power: 0.68\n633\t    cumulative_4_admin_power: 0.74\n634\t    cumulative_power_gain_3_vs_1: 0.26\n635\t    bayes_factor_threshold: 3.0\n636\t    posterior_prob_contaminated_at_3_admin: 0.82\n637\t  result_rationale: '单次评估在δ=1.0时功率仅0.42（与Phase 2模拟一致：N=80/δ=1.0的ETS C TPR=0.51）， 但贝叶斯框架通过将前一次的后验作为下一次的先验，实现了证据的系统累积。\n638\t    每次新增N=80的模型队列时，后验分布逐步收窄。3次累积后功率达0.68，接近 单次大效应量(δ=1.4)的检测水平。这对中等污染效应的长期监控具有实际价值——\n639\t    不需要一次性检测到，通过持续监控同样可以积累足够证据。\n640\t\n641\t    '\n642\t  tables:\n643\t  - name: 'Table 12: Cumulative Bayesian DIF Power Trajectory'\n644\t    columns:\n645\t    - n_administrations\n646\t    - cumulative_n\n647\t    - power_delta_1_0\n648\t    - power_delta_0_8\n649\t    - posterior_prob\n650\t    rows:\n651\t    - - 1\n652\t      - 80\n653\t      - 0.42\n654\t      - 0.28\n655\t      - 0.55\n656\t    - - 2\n657\t      - 160\n658\t      - 0.55\n659\t      - 0.38\n660\t      - 0.68\n661\t    - - 3\n662\t      - 240\n663\t      - 0.68\n664\t      - 0.5\n665\t      - 0.82\n666\t    - - 4\n667\t      - 320\n668\t      - 0.74\n669\t      - 0.58\n670\t      - 0.89\n671\t  figures_description:\n672\t  - 'Figure 14: Power accumulation curves for δ=0.8 and δ=1.0 across successive administrations,\n673\t    with single-shot thresholds for comparison.'\n674\t  analysis: '累积贝叶斯DIF将中效应量检测从\"单次不可行\"转变为\"持续监控可行\"， 为benchmark的长期健康监控提供了理论框架。这是对Reviewer\n675\t    Concern #1 (\"DIF power only sufficient for large effects\")的直接回应。\n676\t\n677\t    '\n678\t- name: Graceful Degradation Analysis\n679\t  plan_id: plan_008\n680\t  description: '形式化分析benchmark在渐进题目替换下的效度退化。 模拟5%/10%/20%/50%替换率，建立理论边界和经验验证。\n681\t\n682\t    '\n683\t  expected_results:\n684\t    ranking_stability_5pct: 0.995\n685\t    ranking_stability_10pct: 0.988\n686\t    ranking_stability_20pct: 0.972\n687\t    ranking_stability_50pct: 0.935\n688\t    score_reliability_5pct: 0.98\n689\t    score_reliability_10pct: 0.96\n690\t    score_reliability_20pct: 0.93\n691\t    score_reliability_50pct: 0.87\n692\t    construct_coverage_5pct: 0.99\n693\t    construct_coverage_20pct: 0.95\n694\t    theoretical_bound_slope: -0.0013\n695\t    critical_replacement_rate: 0.35\n696\t  result_rationale: '排名稳定性退化速率受锚题数量和替换题的校准质量共同决定。在bifactor等值框架下， 锚题固定了量尺，替换题通过fixed-parameter\n697\t    calibration对齐到同一量尺上。 因此退化是平滑的、可预测的：每替换1%的题目，Spearman ρ下降约0.0013。 在20%替换率时ρ=0.972（仍然很高）是因为800道锚题提供了充足的量尺锚定。\n698\t    50%替换时ρ=0.935——仍然可接受但接近边界。临界替换率~35%对应ρ=0.95的常用阈值。 Score reliability退化更快是因为信度对测量误差更敏感。\n699\t\n700\t    '\n701\t  tables:\n702\t  - name: 'Table 13: Graceful Degradation Metrics'\n703\t    columns:\n704\t    - replacement_rate\n705\t    - spearman_rho\n706\t    - score_reliability\n707\t    - construct_coverage\n708\t    - n_items_replaced\n709\t    rows:\n710\t    - - 0%\n711\t      - 1.0\n712\t      - 1.0\n713\t      - 1.0\n714\t      - 0\n715\t    - - 5%\n716\t      - 0.995\n717\t      - 0.98\n718\t      - 0.99\n719\t      - 625\n720\t    - - 10%\n721\t      - 0.988\n722\t      - 0.96\n723\t      - 0.98\n724\t      - 1251\n725\t    - - 20%\n726\t      - 0.972\n727\t      - 0.93\n728\t      - 0.95\n729\t      - 2502\n730\t    - - 50%\n731\t      - 0.935\n732\t      - 0.87\n733\t      - 0.89\n734\t      - 6254\n735\t  figures_description:\n736\t  - 'Figure 15: Three-panel degradation curves (ranking stability, score reliability,\n737\t    construct coverage) as function of replacement rate, with theoretical bounds and\n738\t    critical threshold marked.'\n739\t  analysis: 'Graceful degradation分析为benchmark再生提供了实用指南：在DIF标记率~15%的情况下， 替换所有标记题目(~1850道)对应~15%替换率，此时ρ=0.990，效度保持极好。\n740\t    即使在最激进的场景(50%替换)下，ρ仍在0.93以上。这为Claim 3提供了理论和经验双重保障。\n741\t\n742\t    '\n743\t- name: Item-Focused Trees\n744\t  plan_id: plan_009\n745\t  description: '实现Tutz & Berger (2016) Item-Focused Trees，将模型发布日期作为连续协变量， 避免任意队列切分。对比检测力和灵活性\n746\t    vs 类别型DIF。\n747\t\n748\t    '\n749\t  expected_results:\n750\t    ift_tpr_delta_1_4: 0.76\n751\t    ift_fpr: 0.045\n752\t    ift_vs_categorical_tpr_diff: -0.02\n753\t    ift_vs_categorical_fpr_diff: 0.005\n754\t    ift_temporal_trend_detected_items: 1950\n755\t    ift_advantage_fine_grained_temporal: true\n756\t    ift_split_point_median_date: 2023-09\n757\t  result_rationale: 'IFT将发布日期视为连续变量，通过递归分裂寻找DIF最大化的分割点。在best档下， IFT的TPR(0.76)与categorical\n758\t    DIF(0.78)相当（差异在抽样误差内），因为 METABENCH的时间分布本身就有自然断点（2023→2024的模型数量骤变）。 IFT的主要优势是避免了arbitrary\n759\t    cohort split的审稿人质疑，且能检测到 fine-grained temporal trends（如2023-Q3到2023-Q4之间的渐进污染积累）。\n760\t    中位分割点落在2023-09符合已知的\"LLM训练数据大规模网络爬取时间窗\"。\n761\t\n762\t    '\n763\t  tables:\n764\t  - name: 'Table 14: IFT vs Categorical DIF Comparison'\n765\t    columns:\n766\t    - method\n767\t    - tpr_delta_1.4\n768\t    - fpr\n769\t    - n_flagged\n770\t    - requires_cohort_definition\n771\t    rows:\n772\t    - - ETS C (temporal)\n773\t      - 0.78\n774\t      - 0.04\n775\t      - 1850\n776\t      - 'yes'\n777\t    - - ETS C (quintile)\n778\t      - 0.74\n779\t      - 0.05\n780\t      - 2100\n781\t      - 'yes'\n782\t    - - Item-Focused Trees\n783\t      - 0.76\n784\t      - 0.045\n785\t      - 1950\n786\t      - 'no'\n787\t  figures_description:\n788\t  - 'Figure 16: IFT temporal split point distribution across items, showing clustering\n789\t    around 2023-Q3/Q4.'\n790\t  analysis: 'IFT作为categorical DIF的complementary方法，消除了审稿人对\"arbitrary cohort definition\"的担忧。检测力相当但获得了temporal\n791\t    resolution的额外信息。\n792\t\n793\t    '\n794\t- name: Architecture-Stratified DIF\n795\t  plan_id: plan_010\n796\t  description: '在decoder-only同质子群(N≈3,000-4,000)上运行DIF，报告IRT拟合诊断， 对比全群体DIF的FPR和TPR。验证架构同质性是否改善拟合。\n797\t\n798\t    '\n799\t  expected_results:\n800\t    n_decoder_only: 3650\n801\t    rmsea_decoder_only: 0.038\n802\t    rmsea_full_population: 0.067\n803\t    cfi_decoder_only: 0.95\n804\t    cfi_full_population: 0.9\n805\t    srmr_decoder_only: 0.032\n806\t    srmr_full_population: 0.058\n807\t    tpr_decoder_only_delta_1_4: 0.81\n808\t    tpr_full_population_delta_1_4: 0.78\n809\t    fpr_decoder_only: 0.032\n810\t    fpr_full_population: 0.042\n811\t    spurious_dif_reduction_pct: 24\n812\t  result_rationale: 'Decoder-only子群移除了encoder-decoder和encoder-only模型引入的架构异质性。 单维IRT的核心假设是\"所有examinee在同一潜在特质上变异\"——不同架构的模型\n813\t    在不同认知操作（如long-context reasoning vs pattern matching）上的相对优势 不同，违反单维性。移除这种异质性后，RMSEA从0.067降至0.038（跨入\"good\n814\t    fit\" 区间），CFI从0.90升至0.95。DIF检测的FPR下降24%（从0.042到0.032），因为 之前部分\"DIF\"实际上是架构差异导致的spurious信号。TPR略升(0.81\n815\t    vs 0.78) 是因为更好的IRT拟合使得真实DIF的统计检验更精确。 关键结论：架构分层改善了拟合，但并非必需——全群体RMSEA=0.067仍在\"acceptable\"\n816\t    范围内(≤0.08)，不构成方法论缺陷。\n817\t\n818\t    '\n819\t  tables:\n820\t  - name: 'Table 15: IRT Fit Diagnostics by Population'\n821\t    columns:\n822\t    - population\n823\t    - N\n824\t    - RMSEA\n825\t    - CFI\n826\t    - TLI\n827\t    - SRMR\n828\t    - fit_quality\n829\t    rows:\n830\t    - - Full (all architectures)\n831\t      - 5219\n832\t      - 0.067\n833\t      - 0.9\n834\t      - 0.89\n835\t      - 0.058\n836\t      - acceptable\n837\t    - - Decoder-only\n838\t      - 3650\n839\t      - 0.038\n840\t      - 0.95\n841\t      - 0.94\n842\t      - 0.032\n843\t      - good\n844\t    - - Decoder-only, neg-disc removed\n845\t      - 3650\n846\t      - 0.031\n847\t      - 0.96\n848\t      - 0.96\n849\t      - 0.027\n850\t      - good\n851\t  - name: 'Table 16: DIF Detection Quality by Population'\n852\t    columns:\n853\t    - population\n854\t    - tpr_delta_1.4\n855\t    - fpr\n856\t    - n_spurious_reduced\n857\t    rows:\n858\t    - - Full\n859\t      - 0.78\n860\t      - 0.042\n861\t      - —\n862\t    - - Decoder-only\n863\t      - 0.81\n864\t      - 0.032\n865\t      - 125 items\n866\t  figures_description:\n867\t  - 'Figure 17: RMSEA comparison bar chart (full vs decoder-only vs decoder-only cleaned),\n868\t    with 0.05 and 0.08 threshold lines.'\n869\t  - 'Figure 18: Item-level DIF flag comparison — Venn diagram showing full-population-only,\n870\t    decoder-only-only, and shared flags.'\n871\t  analysis: 'Architecture-stratified分析提供了\"改善但非必需\"的关键结论：decoder-only子群 的IRT拟合达到\"good\"水平(RMSEA<0.05)，全群体仍在\"acceptable\"范围。这意味着\n872\t    论文的主分析可以使用全群体（最大化样本量和代表性），同时以decoder-only子群 分析作为robustness check。这直接化解了Reviewer\n873\t    Concern关于\"IRT misfit\"的担忧。\n874\t\n875\t    '\n876\t- name: Semi-Synthetic Contamination Validation\n877\t  plan_id: plan_011\n878\t  description: '在真实METABENCH响应矩阵中注入已知污染信号，提供controlled ground truth验证。 500道clean题中选100-200道注入synthetic\n879\t    contamination，变化注入参数。\n880\t\n881\t    '\n882\t  expected_results:\n883\t    semi_synthetic_tpr_delta_ge_1_4_p1: 0.81\n884\t    semi_synthetic_tpr_delta_ge_1_4_p08: 0.72\n885\t    semi_synthetic_tpr_delta_ge_1_4_p06: 0.55\n886\t    semi_synthetic_fpr: 0.035\n887\t    tpr_prevalence_5pct: 0.79\n888\t    tpr_prevalence_15pct: 0.81\n889\t    tpr_prevalence_30pct: 0.78\n890\t    tpr_focal_n40: 0.62\n891\t    tpr_focal_n80: 0.78\n892\t    tpr_focal_n200: 0.85\n893\t    injection_recovery_rate: 0.83\n894\t    false_discovery_rate: 0.04\n895\t  result_rationale: 'Semi-synthetic验证的关键优势在于：在保持真实数据的全部统计结构（item相关性、 ability分布、缺失模式）的同时，精确控制ground\n896\t    truth。注入操作直接修改 focal group模型的response vector（incorrect→correct with probability\n897\t    p）， 产生的DIF效应量大小由p和δ共同决定。 在p=1.0(完全利用)时TPR=0.81与Phase 2模拟(0.80)高度一致，验证了模拟的 生态效度。FPR=0.035（低于模拟的0.04）是因为真实数据中的item相关结构\n898\t    提供了额外的背景信息，减少了false alarm。 不同prevalence(5%-30%)下TPR稳定在0.78-0.81，说明ETS C的magnitude-based\n899\t    检测不受prevalence影响（unlike p-value based methods which inflate FPR at high prevalence）。focal\n900\t    group size的影响符合模拟预测：N=40时TPR=0.62 （低于N≥80的pass criterion），N=200时TPR=0.85（best档上限）。\n901\t\n902\t    '\n903\t  tables:\n904\t  - name: 'Table 17: Semi-Synthetic Validation Results'\n905\t    columns:\n906\t    - exploitation_p\n907\t    - delta\n908\t    - focal_N\n909\t    - prevalence\n910\t    - tpr\n911\t    - fpr\n912\t    rows:\n913\t    - - 1.0\n914\t      - 1.6\n915\t      - 80\n916\t      - 15%\n917\t      - 0.81\n918\t      - 0.035\n919\t    - - 1.0\n920\t      - 1.4\n921\t      - 80\n922\t      - 15%\n923\t      - 0.78\n924\t      - 0.033\n925\t    - - 0.8\n926\t      - 1.4\n927\t      - 80\n928\t      - 15%\n929\t      - 0.72\n930\t      - 0.031\n931\t    - - 0.6\n932\t      - 1.4\n933\t      - 80\n934\t      - 15%\n935\t      - 0.55\n936\t      - 0.028\n937\t    - - 1.0\n938\t      - 1.4\n939\t      - 40\n940\t      - 15%\n941\t      - 0.62\n942\t      - 0.038\n943\t    - - 1.0\n944\t      - 1.4\n945\t      - 200\n946\t      - 15%\n947\t      - 0.85\n948\t      - 0.03\n949\t    - - 1.0\n950\t      - 1.4\n951\t      - 80\n952\t      - 5%\n953\t      - 0.79\n954\t      - 0.032\n955\t    - - 1.0\n956\t      - 1.4\n957\t      - 80\n958\t      - 30%\n959\t      - 0.78\n960\t      - 0.04\n961\t  - name: 'Table 18: Simulation vs Semi-Synthetic Comparison'\n962\t    columns:\n963\t    - condition\n964\t    - sim_tpr\n965\t    - semi_synth_tpr\n966\t    - difference\n967\t    rows:\n968\t    - - N=80, δ=1.4\n969\t      - 0.682\n970\t      - 0.78\n971\t      - '+0.098'\n972\t    - - N=100, δ=1.4\n973\t      - 0.758\n974\t      - 0.81\n975\t      - '+0.052'\n976\t    - - N=100, δ=1.6\n977\t      - 0.797\n978\t      - 0.83\n979\t      - '+0.033'\n980\t  figures_description:\n981\t  - 'Figure 19: 3D surface plot of TPR as function of exploitation rate (p) and focal\n982\t    group size (N), with FPR contours overlaid.'\n983\t  - 'Figure 20: Phase 2 simulation vs semi-synthetic validation comparison — paired\n984\t    TPR values showing semi-synthetic consistently slightly higher (real data structure\n985\t    helps).'\n986\t  analysis: Semi-synthetic验证是best档的核心贡献之一：它提供了MMLU-CF(κ=0.14)和 GSM1K都无法提供的controlled\n987\t    ground truth。TPR=0.81(δ≥1.4, p=1.0)直接 落入best档指标范围[0.65, 0.85]的上段。Semi-synthetic结果一致性地高于\n988\t    纯模拟(+3-10pp)，说明真实数据的统计结构对DIF检测有利而非不利—— 这消除了\"模拟结果可能过于乐观\"的审稿人担忧。\n989\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f0962425-fc6b-4f68-9f31-f0e56d22985d","uuid":"c337f1ee-95ff-45cf-bef4-08b5ecc4656f","timestamp":"2026-05-20T21:26:44.708Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260520T205007/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始framing完全成立：DIF是RL无法掩盖的唯一污染信号（因为它操作在群体级ICC上）， 结合多信号ensemble实现全效应量覆盖，bifactor\n  IRT等值实现心理测量等价的benchmark再生。 Headline: \"在5,219个模型的最大规模DIF分析中，ETS C在δ≥1.4时达到TPR 0.72-0.85/FPR<0.05，\n  且在RL训练模型上保持检测力，而10种现有方法退化至随机水平。\" 三条Claim均以强形式陈述，无需降级。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Real-Data DIF on METABENCH MMLU\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '在METABENCH 5,219模型×12,508题的完整响应矩阵上执行ETS C DIF检测。 时序队列(2023 N=1253\n    vs 2024-H1 N=658)，能力五分位队列， ±负区分度题敏感性分析，within-family混淆控制，领域特异性分析。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_ets_c_flagged_temporal: 1850\n    n_items_ets_c_flagged_quintile: 2100\n    pct_flagged_temporal: 0.148\n    pct_flagged_quintile: 0.168\n    li_et_al_overlap_precision: 0.62\n    li_et_al_overlap_recall: 0.38\n    li_et_al_correlation_phi: 0.31\n    temporal_vs_quintile_flag_overlap_jaccard: 0.58\n    neg_disc_sensitivity_flag_delta_pct: -12.0\n    within_family_llama_n_dif_items: 280\n    within_family_qwen_n_dif_items: 195\n    cross_cohort_within_family_overlap_pct: 68.0\n    domain_specificity_stem_overrepresentation_or: 1.8\n    domain_specificity_humanities_underrepresentation_or: 0.65\n  result_rationale: '时序队列N远超模拟的80-100（实际1253 vs 658），统计功效充裕，ETS C的effect-size阈值 (|ΔMH|≥1.5)在大样本下更精确。Li\n    et al.标注的39.5%污染率中，约60-65%的\"input+label\" 类污染会产生δ≥1.4的大效应量DIF（模型见过完整题答对概率显著上升），因此precision~0.62。\n    Recall受限于δ<1.4的中小效应量污染（Li et al.的input-only类别），约0.38。 Within-family分析中Llama-2→3→3.1跨代能力增长是已知的，但DIF标记主要集中在STEM领域\n    （已知训练数据中代码/数学语料重复率高），且cross-cohort与within-family重叠率68%表明 大部分DIF标记反映的是污染而非纯能力增长——能力增长应在within-family中不产生DIF\n    （因为同一family的能力轨迹被控制了），只有当新版本额外暴露于更多训练数据时才会出现。 负区分度题移除后flag数下降12%，说明这些病态题会产生少量虚假DIF。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: DIF Detection Summary by Cohort Definition'\n    columns:\n    - cohort_type\n    - n_focal\n    - n_reference\n    - n_flagged_C\n    - pct_flagged\n    - li_precision\n    - li_recall\n    rows:\n    - - temporal (2023 vs 2024)\n      - 658\n      - 1253\n      - 1850\n      - 14.8%\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.38\n    - - quintile (Q5 vs Q1-Q3)\n      - 1044\n      - 3131\n      - 2100\n      - 16.8%\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.42\n    - - temporal, neg-disc removed\n      - 658\n      - 1253\n      - 1630\n      - 15.3%*\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.34\n    - - temporal, within-family Llama\n      - 135\n      - 308\n      - 280\n      - 2.2%\n      - —\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table 2: Domain-Specificity of DIF Flags'\n    columns:\n    - domain_cluster\n    - n_items\n    - n_flagged\n    - flag_rate\n    - odds_ratio_vs_baseline\n    rows:\n    - - STEM (math/physics/CS)\n      - 3200\n      - 620\n      - 19.4%\n      - 1.8\n    - - Social Sciences\n      - 3800\n      - 510\n      - 13.4%\n      - 0.95\n    - - Humanities\n      - 3100\n      - 340\n      - 11.0%\n      - 0.65\n    - - Professional/Other\n      - 2408\n      - 380\n      - 15.8%\n      - 1.1\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1: Heatmap of DIF flag density across 57 MMLU subjects, colored by ETS\n    C magnitude. STEM subjects show systematic hot spots.'\n  - 'Figure 2: Venn diagram of temporal vs quintile vs within-family DIF flags, showing\n    68% overlap between cross-cohort and within-family.'\n  - 'Figure 3: Scatter plot of per-item DIF ΔMH vs Li et al. contamination category\n    (clean/input-only/input+label), showing clear separation for input+label items.'\n  analysis: 'Real-data DIF在METABENCH规模上运行成功，14.8%的题目被标记为ETS C级DIF，与Li et al. 的39.5%总污染率一致（DIF仅捕获大效应量污染）。Within-family分析是关键混淆控制：\n    68%的重叠率表明DIF标记主要反映污染暴露差异，而非纯能力演进。STEM领域的1.8×过度表征 与已知的代码/数学训练数据重复模式一致，增强了因果推断。负区分度题敏感性分析建议\n    在主分析中排除这些题目以减少FPR，但定性结论不变。\n\n    '\n- name: RL Robustness Empirical Validation\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '三队列设计验证DIF的RL鲁棒性：SFT-only基线、alignment-RL(DPO/ORPO, N=477)、 reasoning-RL(DeepSeek-R1/Qwen2.5-RL等10-15个GRPO/PPO模型混入focal队列)。\n    同时在reasoning-RL模型上运行Min-K%和ConStat作为对比基线。 部分利用率功率分析：p∈[0.4,1.0]的DIF效应量衰减曲线。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    dif_retention_ratio_alignment_rl: 0.97\n    dif_retention_ratio_reasoning_rl_mixed: 0.93\n    constat_auroc_non_rl: 0.78\n    constat_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.53\n    mink_auroc_non_rl: 0.72\n    mink_auroc_reasoning_rl: 0.51\n    dif_auroc_stable: 0.91\n    delong_p_dif_vs_constat_rl: 0.0003\n    tost_equivalence_dif_retention_p: 0.02\n    partial_exploitation_p1_tpr: 0.78\n    partial_exploitation_p08_tpr: 0.68\n    partial_exploitation_p06_tpr: 0.52\n    partial_exploitation_p05_tpr: 0.41\n    partial_exploitation_p04_tpr: 0.3\n    ensemble_handoff_point_p: 0.52\n    bootstrap_ci_dif_auroc_95:\n    - 0.88\n    - 0.94\n    bootstrap_ci_constat_rl_auroc_95:\n    - 0.47\n    - 0.59\n  result_rationale: 'DIF的RL鲁棒性来自其操作层级：它检测的是群体级ICC偏移（\"这批模型对这道题异常容易\"）， 而非单模型的output\n    distribution。GRPO/PPO平滑的是单模型的token-level概率分布 （NLL gap contraction），但无法改变\"已污染模型答对概率更高\"这一群体行为模式——\n    除非RL训练恰好让模型\"忘记\"污染知识，而这与污染的定义矛盾。 Alignment-RL(DPO)的retention ratio更高(0.97)是因为DPO根本不涉及NLL\n    gap机制。 Reasoning-RL混入后retention ratio 0.93（>0.90阈值）：混入10-15个RL模型到N=658的 focal队列中，对群体ICC的影响微乎其微（<2.3%的样本）。\n    ConStat在reasoning-RL上退化至0.53（近随机）是因为GRPO训练使模型对输入扰动的敏感度 被系统性平滑——Wang et al.已实证报告14-20pp\n    AUROC下降。 部分利用率分析：p=1.0时效应量=全量δ，TPR=0.78；p降低时效应量线性缩放~p×δ， 在p≈0.52时DIF的TPR降至~0.41，此时ensemble的ConStat信号(对非RL模型有效)接手覆盖。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: DIF vs Baseline Detectors across Model Types'\n    columns:\n    - detector\n    - cohort\n    - auroc\n    - auroc_95ci_lo\n    - auroc_95ci_hi\n    - tpr_at_fpr05\n    rows:\n    - - DIF (ETS C)\n      - SFT-only\n      - 0.92\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.95\n      - 0.79\n    - - DIF (ETS C)\n      - Alignment-RL mixed\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.94\n      - 0.78\n    - - DIF (ETS C)\n      - Reasoning-RL mixed\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.88\n      - 0.94\n      - 0.76\n    - - ConStat\n      - SFT-only\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.73\n      - 0.83\n      - 0.55\n    - - ConStat\n      - Reasoning-RL (individual)\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.47\n      - 0.59\n      - 0.12\n    - - Min-K%\n      - SFT-only\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.66\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.42\n    - - Min-K%\n      - Reasoning-RL (individual)\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.44\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.08\n  - name: 'Table 4: Partial Exploitation Power Curve'\n    columns:\n    - exploitation_rate_p\n    - effective_delta\n    - ets_c_tpr\n    - ensemble_tpr\n    - coverage_gap\n    rows:\n    - - 1.0\n      - 1.6\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.82\n      - none\n    - - 0.8\n      - 1.28\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.74\n      - none\n    - - 0.6\n      - 0.96\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.65\n      - none (ConStat补)\n    - - 0.5\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.58\n      - marginal\n    - - 0.4\n      - 0.64\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.48\n      - ensemble边界\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 4: Paired bar chart — DIF AUROC stays flat (~0.91) across three cohort\n    compositions while ConStat/Min-K% collapse on reasoning-RL. Error bars are bootstrap\n    95% CIs.'\n  - 'Figure 5: Partial exploitation power curve — DIF TPR as function of p, with ensemble\n    handoff zone shaded. Shows DIF→ensemble transition at p≈0.52.'\n  analysis: 'RL鲁棒性以双层证据确认：(1)群体级DIF在三种队列组成下AUROC稳定在0.91±0.03， TOST等价检验p=0.02拒绝了\"DIF在RL队列中退化\"的假设；(2)个体级ConStat/Min-K%\n    在reasoning-RL模型上退化至随机水平(0.51-0.53)。DeLong检验p=0.0003确认DIF 与ConStat在RL模型上的AUROC差异具有统计显著性。部分利用率分析画出了清晰的\n    覆盖边界：DIF单独覆盖p≥0.6，ensemble补完至p≈0.4-0.5，p<0.4时污染对排名 影响已可忽略(δ<0.64，对应排名变动<2位)。\n\n    '\n- name: ConStat Perturbation Testing Evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_003a\n  description: '在200+道MMLU题上生成语义等价重述，对比原始vs重述表现，执行FDR控制检测。 评估对非RL模型的检测力，以及对RL模型的预期退化。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_reformulated: 250\n    n_models_evaluated: 50\n    constat_auroc_non_rl: 0.78\n    constat_auroc_full_population: 0.68\n    constat_fdr_controlled_tpr_non_rl: 0.52\n    constat_fdr_controlled_fpr: 0.04\n    constat_auroc_rl_models: 0.53\n    perturbation_sensitivity_mean_non_rl: 0.18\n    perturbation_sensitivity_mean_rl: 0.06\n    perturbation_sensitivity_ratio: 3.0\n  result_rationale: 'ConStat的机制是检测模型对语义等价扰动的不对称敏感性：污染模型对原始题目 过拟合，重述后表现下降更大。非RL模型的output\n    distribution保留了这种不对称 （训练时直接记忆了原始措辞），AUROC~0.78。RL模型经过GRPO/PPO后，token概率 被平滑化（NLL\n    gap缩小），对扰动的敏感性差异被抹平，AUROC退化至0.53。 扰动敏感性比值3.0（非RL/RL）直接量化了RL平滑效应的程度。这个结果验证了 ConStat作为ensemble中非RL模型专用信号的定位。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: ConStat Detection Power by Model Type'\n    columns:\n    - model_type\n    - n_models\n    - auroc\n    - tpr_at_fdr05\n    - mean_sensitivity\n    rows:\n    - - SFT-only\n      - 25\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.18\n    - - DPO/ORPO\n      - 15\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.11\n    - - GRPO/PPO\n      - 10\n      - 0.53\n      - 0.12\n      - 0.06\n    - - All\n      - 50\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.13\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 6: Distribution of perturbation sensitivity scores by model type, showing\n    clear bimodal separation for SFT-only models and collapsed distribution for GRPO/PPO\n    models.'\n  analysis: 'ConStat在非RL模型上表现可靠(AUROC 0.78)，填补DIF在中效应量区间的覆盖空白。 关键发现是RL平滑效应的定量刻画：GRPO/PPO模型的扰动敏感性仅为SFT模型的1/3，\n    直接解释了Wang et al.报告的AUROC退化。这为ensemble设计提供了明确的信号分配策略。\n\n    '\n- name: DVD Generation Variance Evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_003b\n  description: '对10-15个开放权重模型，每题生成50个响应(T=0.7-1.0)，计算生成方差， 检测双峰分布（variant污染信号）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models_evaluated: 12\n    n_items_tested: 500\n    dvd_variant_detection_tpr: 0.68\n    dvd_variant_detection_fpr: 0.07\n    dvd_verbatim_detection_tpr: 0.45\n    dvd_bimodal_items_detected: 85\n    generation_entropy_clean_mean: 1.42\n    generation_entropy_contaminated_mean: 0.73\n    entropy_separation_cohens_d: 1.15\n  result_rationale: 'DVD检测的机制是：变体污染（模型见过原题的不同版本）会导致生成分布出现多模态 ——模型在不同\"记忆版本\"之间切换。对于variant\n    contamination（δ≥0.8）， 生成方差显著降低（entropy从1.42降至0.73），TPR达0.68。对verbatim contamination，\n    模型响应高度集中在唯一正确答案上，方差反而极低但不呈双峰，所以TPR仅0.45—— 这正是DIF信号的覆盖区域。entropy的Cohen''s d=1.15说明clean\n    vs contaminated 题目在生成分布层面的差异是大效应量的。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: DVD Detection by Contamination Type'\n    columns:\n    - contamination_type\n    - n_items\n    - tpr\n    - fpr\n    - mean_entropy\n    rows:\n    - - variant\n      - 120\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.07\n      - 0.73\n    - - verbatim\n      - 180\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.38\n    - - clean\n      - 200\n      - —\n      - 0.07\n      - 1.42\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 7: Kernel density estimates of generation entropy for clean, verbatim-contaminated,\n    and variant-contaminated items, showing clear three-way separation.'\n  analysis: 'DVD填补了ensemble中variant contamination的检测空白。与DIF互补性强： DIF擅长verbatim大效应量(TPR~0.78)，DVD擅长variant中等效应量(TPR~0.68)。\n    两者的FPR均在可接受范围。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-Signal Ensemble Fusion\n  plan_id: plan_003c\n  description: '融合DIF+ConStat+DVD为多信号ensemble，校准阈值，评估覆盖率和FPR。 2-of-3投票 vs 加权融合，5折交叉验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ensemble_tpr_delta_ge_1_4: 0.82\n    ensemble_tpr_delta_ge_0_8: 0.72\n    ensemble_fpr: 0.055\n    majority_vote_tpr: 0.74\n    majority_vote_fpr: 0.04\n    weighted_fusion_tpr: 0.78\n    weighted_fusion_fpr: 0.06\n    uniform_weight_tpr: 0.75\n    uniform_weight_fpr: 0.055\n    cv_5fold_tpr_std: 0.03\n    cv_5fold_fpr_std: 0.01\n    coverage_dif_only_pct: 58\n    coverage_ensemble_pct: 82\n    marginal_gain_constat: 15\n    marginal_gain_dvd: 9\n  result_rationale: 'Ensemble的核心价值在于互补覆盖：DIF覆盖大效应量(δ≥1.4)+RL-robust场景， ConStat覆盖中效应量(δ∈[0.6,1.4])+非RL模型，DVD覆盖variant\n    contamination。 三信号组合后，总覆盖率从DIF单信号的58%提升至82%。2-of-3投票更保守(FPR 0.04) 但TPR牺牲(0.74)；加权融合(DIF权重0.45,\n    ConStat 0.35, DVD 0.20)在5折CV上 达到TPR 0.78/FPR 0.06的最优平衡。FPR<0.08满足best档指标。 交叉验证TPR标准差仅0.03，说明融合权重稳定。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Ensemble Strategies Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - strategy\n    - tpr_delta_ge_1.4\n    - tpr_delta_ge_0.8\n    - fpr\n    - coverage_pct\n    rows:\n    - - DIF only\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.04\n      - 58\n    - - ConStat only\n      - 0.52\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.04\n      - 38\n    - - DVD only\n      - 0.45\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.07\n      - 32\n    - - 2-of-3 majority\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.04\n      - 72\n    - - Weighted fusion (optimized)\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.06\n      - 78\n    - - Weighted fusion (uniform)\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.055\n      - 75\n    - - Full ensemble (union)\n      - 0.82\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.055\n      - 82\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 8: Stacked coverage chart showing each signal''s unique and shared detection\n    regions across the effect-size × model-type landscape.'\n  - 'Figure 9: ROC curves for individual signals and ensemble strategies, with per-signal\n    confidence bands.'\n  analysis: 'Ensemble实现了\"全效应量覆盖\"的Claim 2：每个信号覆盖其他信号的盲区。 ConStat的边际增益(+15%)大于DVD(+9%)，因为中效应量污染比variant污染更常见。\n    Uniform权重基线(TPR 0.75)仅比优化权重低3pp，说明融合策略对权重选择不敏感—— 这是审稿人喜欢看到的鲁棒性证据。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-Benchmark GSM8K Validation\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '在GSM8K上复现DIF分析，利用GSM1K作为独立ground truth。 收集50+模型的逐题binary response，跨时序队列运行DIF，\n    将DIF标记与per-model GSM8K-GSM1K accuracy gap关联。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_models_gsm8k: 65\n    n_items_gsm8k: 1319\n    gsm8k_dif_flagged_items: 185\n    gsm8k_dif_flag_rate: 0.14\n    gsm8k_gsm1k_gap_mean: 0.085\n    gsm8k_dif_gap_correlation_r: 0.58\n    gsm8k_dif_gap_correlation_p: 1.0e-05\n    dif_flagged_items_mean_gap: 0.13\n    dif_clean_items_mean_gap: 0.06\n    gap_difference_cohens_d: 0.92\n  result_rationale: 'GSM8K是DIF验证的理想案例：GSM1K提供了真正独立的ground truth（完全新写的1000道 数学题），GSM8K-GSM1K\n    accuracy gap直接反映污染影响。r=0.58的相关性来自： DIF标记的题目正是那些模型在原始GSM8K上\"异常好\"（因为见过）而在GSM1K上表现\n    正常（没见过）的题目。被DIF标记题目的平均gap(0.13)是未标记题(0.06)的2.2倍， Cohen''s d=0.92构成大效应量差异。样本量(N=65模型)小于MMLU的5219，但GSM8K\n    题目同质性更高（全是数学），IRT拟合更好，部分补偿了样本量劣势。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: GSM8K DIF vs GSM1K Gap Analysis'\n    columns:\n    - item_group\n    - n_items\n    - mean_gap\n    - std_gap\n    - dif_flag_rate\n    rows:\n    - - DIF-flagged (ETS C)\n      - 185\n      - 0.13\n      - 0.08\n      - 1.0\n    - - DIF-clean\n      - 1134\n      - 0.06\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.0\n    - - All GSM8K\n      - 1319\n      - 0.07\n      - 0.06\n      - 0.14\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 10: Scatter plot of per-item DIF ΔMH magnitude vs GSM8K-GSM1K gap, with\n    regression line and 95% CI band. r=0.58.'\n  analysis: 'GSM8K验证提供了独立于MMLU的cross-benchmark证据。r=0.58的相关性虽然不是完美 对应（因为GSM1K gap也受能力差异影响），但在可控混淆下仍然构成strong\n    evidence。 这直接回应了Reviewer Concern #3（\"仅在模拟中验证\"）和#8（ground truth可靠性）。\n\n    '\n- name: Bifactor IRT Equating Pilot\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '在METABENCH MMLU数据上拟合bifactor模型(general factor + 57 subject-specific\n    factors)， 选锚题，执行fixed-parameter calibration等值，验证等值后排名保持度。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    bifactor_converged: true\n    bifactor_rmsea: 0.043\n    bifactor_cfi: 0.94\n    bifactor_general_factor_variance_explained: 0.62\n    n_anchor_items_selected: 800\n    anchor_stability_icc: 0.96\n    anchor_cross_cohort_dif_rate: 0.02\n    equating_spearman_rho: 0.975\n    equating_kendall_tau: 0.962\n    equating_rank_displacement_mean: 1.8\n    equating_rank_displacement_max: 12\n    n_items_replaced: 500\n    replaced_difficulty_correlation: 0.88\n    replaced_discrimination_correlation: 0.82\n  result_rationale: 'Bifactor模型在大样本(N=5219)上收敛性好——METABENCH的样本量远超心理测量学 通常要求的N=500-1000。General\n    factor解释62%方差反映MMLU测量的主要是一般 认知能力/知识广度，subject-specific factors吸收了领域特异能力。RMSEA=0.043\n    在decoder-only为主的群体上拟合良好（异质性主要来自架构差异，而decoder-only 占70%+）。800道锚题的筛选标准是：(1)跨队列无DIF标记，(2)discrimination>0.3，\n    (3)difficulty在[-2,2]内。等值后Spearman rho=0.975表明：即使替换了500道题， bifactor等值框架成功保持了模型排名，平均排名位移仅1.8位。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Bifactor Model Fit Statistics'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - full_population\n    - decoder_only_subset\n    - threshold\n    rows:\n    - - RMSEA\n      - 0.062\n      - 0.043\n      - <0.08 acceptable / <0.05 good\n    - - CFI\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.94\n      - '>0.90 acceptable / >0.95 good'\n    - - General factor % variance\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.62\n      - '>0.50'\n    - - N anchor items\n      - 780\n      - 800\n      - '>500'\n  - name: 'Table 10: Equating Quality Metrics'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - target\n    rows:\n    - - Spearman ρ (original vs equated)\n      - 0.975\n      - ≥0.95\n    - - Kendall τ\n      - 0.962\n      - ≥0.93\n    - - Mean rank displacement\n      - 1.8\n      - <5\n    - - Max rank displacement\n      - 12\n      - <20\n    - - '% models within ±3 ranks'\n      - 89%\n      - '>80%'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 11: Bifactor path diagram showing general and subject-specific factor\n    loadings.'\n  - 'Figure 12: Original vs equated model rankings scatter plot with identity line,\n    showing tight clustering around diagonal.'\n  analysis: 'Bifactor等值成功实现了Claim 3的核心承诺：被污染题可以被替换，且替换后的benchmark 通过psychometric equating保持与原始benchmark的可比性。ρ=0.975远超0.95阈值，\n    说明等值框架在实践中是有效的。General factor的62%方差解释率也验证了单一general ability维度假设的合理性，为unidimensional\n    IRT在DIF检测中的应用提供了理论支撑。\n\n    '\n- name: Item Generation & Calibration\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '为DIF标记的MMLU题目生成替换题，使用student simulation进行经验校准， 对比prompt-based difficulty\n    targeting vs empirical calibration。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_items_generated: 500\n    n_items_passing_quality: 420\n    student_sim_difficulty_rho: 0.79\n    prompt_based_difficulty_rho: 0.28\n    student_sim_discrimination_rho: 0.72\n    construct_coverage_maintained: true\n    holdout_validation_rho: 0.76\n    generation_pass_rate: 0.84\n    subject_distribution_kl_divergence: 0.03\n  result_rationale: 'Student simulation (arXiv 2601.09953)通过模拟不同能力水平的\"学生模型\"回答新题 来经验估计难度，绕过了直接prompt\n    difficulty targeting的根本困难（LLM无法准确 预测自己的正确率）。rho=0.79的难度相关性在文献报告的0.75-0.82范围内。\n    Prompt-based targeting仅rho=0.28（文献报告0.10-0.45），差距2.8×。 区分度相关性0.72稍低是因为区分度取决于题目与能力的非线性关系，更难通过\n    生成控制。84%的生成通过率说明LLM在给定construct约束下生成高质量MCQ是可行的。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 11: Calibration Method Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - difficulty_ρ\n    - discrimination_ρ\n    - construct_match\n    - items_passing\n    rows:\n    - - Student simulation\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.72\n      - 92%\n      - 420\n    - - Prompt-based targeting\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.21\n      - 88%\n      - 380\n    - - Random generation (baseline)\n      - 0.05\n      - 0.03\n      - 75%\n      - 280\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 13: Calibration scatter plots — student-sim predicted vs actual difficulty,\n    prompt-based vs actual, side by side.'\n  analysis: 'Student simulation calibration显著优于prompt-based targeting，验证了 \"经验校准优于语言指定\"的核心假设。结合plan_005的bifactor等值，\n    完整的regeneration pipeline(DIF检测→题目生成→经验校准→等值)已可行。\n\n    '\n- name: Cumulative Bayesian DIF\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '实现Sinharay et al. (2006)累积贝叶斯DIF先验。模拟4次连续benchmark评估， 展示证据累积如何提升中等效应量的检测力。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    single_admin_power_delta_1_0: 0.42\n    cumulative_2_admin_power: 0.55\n    cumulative_3_admin_power: 0.68\n    cumulative_4_admin_power: 0.74\n    cumulative_power_gain_3_vs_1: 0.26\n    bayes_factor_threshold: 3.0\n    posterior_prob_contaminated_at_3_admin: 0.82\n  result_rationale: '单次评估在δ=1.0时功率仅0.42（与Phase 2模拟一致：N=80/δ=1.0的ETS C TPR=0.51）， 但贝叶斯框架通过将前一次的后验作为下一次的先验，实现了证据的系统累积。\n    每次新增N=80的模型队列时，后验分布逐步收窄。3次累积后功率达0.68，接近 单次大效应量(δ=1.4)的检测水平。这对中等污染效应的长期监控具有实际价值——\n    不需要一次性检测到，通过持续监控同样可以积累足够证据。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 12: Cumulative Bayesian DIF Power Trajectory'\n    columns:\n    - n_administrations\n    - cumulative_n\n    - power_delta_1_0\n    - power_delta_0_8\n    - posterior_prob\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 80\n      - 0.42\n      - 0.28\n      - 0.55\n    - - 2\n      - 160\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.38\n      - 0.68\n    - - 3\n      - 240\n      - 0.68\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.82\n    - - 4\n      - 320\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.58\n      - 0.89\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 14: Power accumulation curves for δ=0.8 and δ=1.0 across successive administrations,\n    with single-shot thresholds for comparison.'\n  analysis: '累积贝叶斯DIF将中效应量检测从\"单次不可行\"转变为\"持续监控可行\"， 为benchmark的长期健康监控提供了理论框架。这是对Reviewer\n    Concern #1 (\"DIF power only sufficient for large effects\")的直接回应。\n\n    '\n- name: Graceful Degradation Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '形式化分析benchmark在渐进题目替换下的效度退化。 模拟5%/10%/20%/50%替换率，建立理论边界和经验验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ranking_stability_5pct: 0.995\n    ranking_stability_10pct: 0.988\n    ranking_stability_20pct: 0.972\n    ranking_stability_50pct: 0.935\n    score_reliability_5pct: 0.98\n    score_reliability_10pct: 0.96\n    score_reliability_20pct: 0.93\n    score_reliability_50pct: 0.87\n    construct_coverage_5pct: 0.99\n    construct_coverage_20pct: 0.95\n    theoretical_bound_slope: -0.0013\n    critical_replacement_rate: 0.35\n  result_rationale: '排名稳定性退化速率受锚题数量和替换题的校准质量共同决定。在bifactor等值框架下， 锚题固定了量尺，替换题通过fixed-parameter\n    calibration对齐到同一量尺上。 因此退化是平滑的、可预测的：每替换1%的题目，Spearman ρ下降约0.0013。 在20%替换率时ρ=0.972（仍然很高）是因为800道锚题提供了充足的量尺锚定。\n    50%替换时ρ=0.935——仍然可接受但接近边界。临界替换率~35%对应ρ=0.95的常用阈值。 Score reliability退化更快是因为信度对测量误差更敏感。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 13: Graceful Degradation Metrics'\n    columns:\n    - replacement_rate\n    - spearman_rho\n    - score_reliability\n    - construct_coverage\n    - n_items_replaced\n    rows:\n    - - 0%\n      - 1.0\n      - 1.0\n      - 1.0\n      - 0\n    - - 5%\n      - 0.995\n      - 0.98\n      - 0.99\n      - 625\n    - - 10%\n      - 0.988\n      - 0.96\n      - 0.98\n      - 1251\n    - - 20%\n      - 0.972\n      - 0.93\n      - 0.95\n      - 2502\n    - - 50%\n      - 0.935\n      - 0.87\n      - 0.89\n      - 6254\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 15: Three-panel degradation curves (ranking stability, score reliability,\n    construct coverage) as function of replacement rate, with theoretical bounds and\n    critical threshold marked.'\n  analysis: 'Graceful degradation分析为benchmark再生提供了实用指南：在DIF标记率~15%的情况下， 替换所有标记题目(~1850道)对应~15%替换率，此时ρ=0.990，效度保持极好。\n    即使在最激进的场景(50%替换)下，ρ仍在0.93以上。这为Claim 3提供了理论和经验双重保障。\n\n    '\n- name: Item-Focused Trees\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: '实现Tutz & Berger (2016) Item-Focused Trees，将模型发布日期作为连续协变量， 避免任意队列切分。对比检测力和灵活性\n    vs 类别型DIF。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ift_tpr_delta_1_4: 0.76\n    ift_fpr: 0.045\n    ift_vs_categorical_tpr_diff: -0.02\n    ift_vs_categorical_fpr_diff: 0.005\n    ift_temporal_trend_detected_items: 1950\n    ift_advantage_fine_grained_temporal: true\n    ift_split_point_median_date: 2023-09\n  result_rationale: 'IFT将发布日期视为连续变量，通过递归分裂寻找DIF最大化的分割点。在best档下， IFT的TPR(0.76)与categorical\n    DIF(0.78)相当（差异在抽样误差内），因为 METABENCH的时间分布本身就有自然断点（2023→2024的模型数量骤变）。 IFT的主要优势是避免了arbitrary\n    cohort split的审稿人质疑，且能检测到 fine-grained temporal trends（如2023-Q3到2023-Q4之间的渐进污染积累）。\n    中位分割点落在2023-09符合已知的\"LLM训练数据大规模网络爬取时间窗\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 14: IFT vs Categorical DIF Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - tpr_delta_1.4\n    - fpr\n    - n_flagged\n    - requires_cohort_definition\n    rows:\n    - - ETS C (temporal)\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.04\n      - 1850\n      - 'yes'\n    - - ETS C (quintile)\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.05\n      - 2100\n      - 'yes'\n    - - Item-Focused Trees\n      - 0.76\n      - 0.045\n      - 1950\n      - 'no'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 16: IFT temporal split point distribution across items, showing clustering\n    around 2023-Q3/Q4.'\n  analysis: 'IFT作为categorical DIF的complementary方法，消除了审稿人对\"arbitrary cohort definition\"的担忧。检测力相当但获得了temporal\n    resolution的额外信息。\n\n    '\n- name: Architecture-Stratified DIF\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: '在decoder-only同质子群(N≈3,000-4,000)上运行DIF，报告IRT拟合诊断， 对比全群体DIF的FPR和TPR。验证架构同质性是否改善拟合。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_decoder_only: 3650\n    rmsea_decoder_only: 0.038\n    rmsea_full_population: 0.067\n    cfi_decoder_only: 0.95\n    cfi_full_population: 0.9\n    srmr_decoder_only: 0.032\n    srmr_full_population: 0.058\n    tpr_decoder_only_delta_1_4: 0.81\n    tpr_full_population_delta_1_4: 0.78\n    fpr_decoder_only: 0.032\n    fpr_full_population: 0.042\n    spurious_dif_reduction_pct: 24\n  result_rationale: 'Decoder-only子群移除了encoder-decoder和encoder-only模型引入的架构异质性。 单维IRT的核心假设是\"所有examinee在同一潜在特质上变异\"——不同架构的模型\n    在不同认知操作（如long-context reasoning vs pattern matching）上的相对优势 不同，违反单维性。移除这种异质性后，RMSEA从0.067降至0.038（跨入\"good\n    fit\" 区间），CFI从0.90升至0.95。DIF检测的FPR下降24%（从0.042到0.032），因为 之前部分\"DIF\"实际上是架构差异导致的spurious信号。TPR略升(0.81\n    vs 0.78) 是因为更好的IRT拟合使得真实DIF的统计检验更精确。 关键结论：架构分层改善了拟合，但并非必需——全群体RMSEA=0.067仍在\"acceptable\"\n    范围内(≤0.08)，不构成方法论缺陷。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 15: IRT Fit Diagnostics by Population'\n    columns:\n    - population\n    - N\n    - RMSEA\n    - CFI\n    - TLI\n    - SRMR\n    - fit_quality\n    rows:\n    - - Full (all architectures)\n      - 5219\n      - 0.067\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.89\n      - 0.058\n      - acceptable\n    - - Decoder-only\n      - 3650\n      - 0.038\n      - 0.95\n      - 0.94\n      - 0.032\n      - good\n    - - Decoder-only, neg-disc removed\n      - 3650\n      - 0.031\n      - 0.96\n      - 0.96\n      - 0.027\n      - good\n  - name: 'Table 16: DIF Detection Quality by Population'\n    columns:\n    - population\n    - tpr_delta_1.4\n    - fpr\n    - n_spurious_reduced\n    rows:\n    - - Full\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.042\n      - —\n    - - Decoder-only\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.032\n      - 125 items\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 17: RMSEA comparison bar chart (full vs decoder-only vs decoder-only cleaned),\n    with 0.05 and 0.08 threshold lines.'\n  - 'Figure 18: Item-level DIF flag comparison — Venn diagram showing full-population-only,\n    decoder-only-only, and shared flags.'\n  analysis: 'Architecture-stratified分析提供了\"改善但非必需\"的关键结论：decoder-only子群 的IRT拟合达到\"good\"水平(RMSEA<0.05)，全群体仍在\"acceptable\"范围。这意味着\n    论文的主分析可以使用全群体（最大化样本量和代表性），同时以decoder-only子群 分析作为robustness check。这直接化解了Reviewer\n    Concern关于\"IRT misfit\"的担忧。\n\n    '\n- name: Semi-Synthetic Contamination Validation\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: '在真实METABENCH响应矩阵中注入已知污染信号，提供controlled ground truth验证。 500道clean题中选100-200道注入synthetic\n    contamination，变化注入参数。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    semi_synthetic_tpr_delta_ge_1_4_p1: 0.81\n    semi_synthetic_tpr_delta_ge_1_4_p08: 0.72\n    semi_synthetic_tpr_delta_ge_1_4_p06: 0.55\n    semi_synthetic_fpr: 0.035\n    tpr_prevalence_5pct: 0.79\n    tpr_prevalence_15pct: 0.81\n    tpr_prevalence_30pct: 0.78\n    tpr_focal_n40: 0.62\n    tpr_focal_n80: 0.78\n    tpr_focal_n200: 0.85\n    injection_recovery_rate: 0.83\n    false_discovery_rate: 0.04\n  result_rationale: 'Semi-synthetic验证的关键优势在于：在保持真实数据的全部统计结构（item相关性、 ability分布、缺失模式）的同时，精确控制ground\n    truth。注入操作直接修改 focal group模型的response vector（incorrect→correct with probability\n    p）， 产生的DIF效应量大小由p和δ共同决定。 在p=1.0(完全利用)时TPR=0.81与Phase 2模拟(0.80)高度一致，验证了模拟的 生态效度。FPR=0.035（低于模拟的0.04）是因为真实数据中的item相关结构\n    提供了额外的背景信息，减少了false alarm。 不同prevalence(5%-30%)下TPR稳定在0.78-0.81，说明ETS C的magnitude-based\n    检测不受prevalence影响（unlike p-value based methods which inflate FPR at high prevalence）。focal\n    group size的影响符合模拟预测：N=40时TPR=0.62 （低于N≥80的pass criterion），N=200时TPR=0.85（best档上限）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 17: Semi-Synthetic Validation Results'\n    columns:\n    - exploitation_p\n    - delta\n    - focal_N\n    - prevalence\n    - tpr\n    - fpr\n    rows:\n    - - 1.0\n      - 1.6\n      - 80\n      - 15%\n      - 0.81\n      - 0.035\n    - - 1.0\n      - 1.4\n      - 80\n      - 15%\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.033\n    - - 0.8\n      - 1.4\n      - 80\n      - 15%\n      - 0.72\n      - 0.031\n    - - 0.6\n      - 1.4\n      - 80\n      - 15%\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.028\n    - - 1.0\n      - 1.4\n      - 40\n      - 15%\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.038\n    - - 1.0\n      - 1.4\n      - 200\n      - 15%\n      - 0.85\n      - 0.03\n    - - 1.0\n      - 1.4\n      - 80\n      - 5%\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.032\n    - - 1.0\n      - 1.4\n      - 80\n      - 30%\n      - 0.78\n      - 0.04\n  - name: 'Table 18: Simulation vs Semi-Synthetic Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - sim_tpr\n    - semi_synth_tpr\n    - difference\n    rows:\n    - - N=80, δ=1.4\n      - 0.682\n      - 0.78\n      - '+0.098'\n    - - N=100, δ=1.4\n      - 0.758\n      - 0.81\n      - '+0.052'\n    - - N=100, δ=1.6\n      - 0.797\n      - 0.83\n      - '+0.033'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 19: 3D surface plot of TPR as function of exploitation rate (p) and focal\n    group size (N), with FPR contours overlaid.'\n  - 'Figure 20: Phase 2 simulation vs semi-synthetic validation comparison — paired\n    TPR values showing semi-synthetic consistently slightly higher (real data structure\n    helps).'\n  analysis: Semi-synthetic验证是best档的核心贡献之一：它提供了MMLU-CF(κ=0.14)和 GSM1K都无法提供的controlled\n    ground truth。TPR=0.81(δ≥1.4, p=1.0)直接 落入best档指标范围[0.65, 0.85]的上段。Semi-synthetic结果一致性地高于\n    纯模拟(+3-10pp)，说明真实数据的统计结构对DIF检测有利而非不利—— 这消除了\"模拟结果可能过于乐观\"的审稿人担忧。\n","numLines":989,"startLine":1,"totalLines":989}}}
